{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"article-content\" id=\"artibody\">\n<p></p><p>貝森特強調，審查英偉達是否遵守出口限制至關重要，並將密切觀察該公司是否故意無視了警示信號。</p><p>此外，貝森特指出，報告顯示在新加坡銷售的晶片中僅有1%留在當地，這引發了對晶片違規流向的嚴重質疑。他要求英偉達董事會及外部律師必須在「未來10天內」就公司的出口限制合規文化作出正式回應。</p> </div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:45:12.949684+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T16:20:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:46:50.008637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T16:38:11.538030+00:00","content_hash":"eedfedb40019da7c5653f34b81910df1f6dff7d41c57efd95134dbf38d2aa251","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:45:12.949684+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}